    "@en": "Both = «was / was sent», but:\n\n- **blev** + participle = **acción**: Hvornår **blev** pakken sendt? (When was it sent?)\n- **var** + participle = the **estado**: Pakken **var** sendt. (It was already sent.)\n\nAs in Spanish: «was closed» versus «It was closed.»."
   },
